    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"stop fighting it\"? what does that even mean? i feel like there's no way back from this. my whole identity was tied to this research. now i'm just a person who wasted years of their life on nothing. everyone is going to see me as a failure. it feels like my life has reached a dead end. like there's no point in even trying to fix it or starting over.",
